tmp/
# No trailing slash, unlike the entries around it: a pattern ending in `/`
# matches directories only, and a symlink is not a directory to git. Linked
# worktrees under .claude/worktrees/ get their node_modules by symlinking the
# main checkout's, which the directory-only form left showing as untracked —
# one `git add .` away from committing the link. The bare form matches both.
node_modules
.next/
.env*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Local planning artifacts — specs, plans, and handovers written while working
# on a change. Deliberately not committed: they are a working record of one
# deployment, carry its internal vocabulary, and are not documentation for
# anyone running a fork. Keep them local; put anything durable in README.md,
# CONTRIBUTING.md, or docs/ops.md instead.
docs/superpowers/

# Design-sweep screenshots: regenerable from docs/design-sweep-2/capture.spec.ts.txt
# and several megabytes of PNG. The prose reports beside them are tracked.
docs/design-sweep-2/shots/
